          "title": "Step 7: Maintain Continuous Coverage",
          "bodyHtml": "<p>North Carolina strictly monitors insurance lapses. Any cancellation or missed payment prompts your insurer to notify the NCDMV, resulting in civil penalty fines, plate revocation, and license suspension. Set up autopay to prevent accidental lapses.</p>"
