          "bodyHtml": "<p>Navigating the insurance requirements of a North Carolina DWI requires methodical execution:</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Review Your Revocation Notice:</strong> Confirm your revocation effective date and eligibility timeline with the NCDMV.</li>\n<li><strong>Purchase Coverage Promptly:</strong> Contact Beacon SR22 Insurance North Carolina at (980) 443-7856 to secure a policy that includes Form DL-123 issuance. We specialize in high-risk coverage to find you competitive rates.</li>\n<li><strong>Complete Required Assessments:</strong> Undergo a state-approved substance abuse assessment.</li>\n<li><strong>Submit Verification:</strong> Provide your DL-123 and petition for <a href=\"/how-to-get-an-sr22-in-nc/\">restricted permit insurance verification</a> to the court or NCDMV.</li>\n<li><strong>Maintain Continuous Compliance:</strong> Maintain your insurance for your entire required period to prevent new suspensions.</li>\n</ul>"
